# cdemu

> Manage emulated CD devices.
> More information: <https://manned.org/cdemu>.

- Mount a CD:

`cdemu load {{device_number}} {{path/to/file.cue}}`

- Unmount CDs:

`cdemu unload {{device_number|all}}`
